## Title: Thanks for the Buff (TFTB)
## Notes: Automatically thank players who buff you with emotes, whispers, and chat notifications, from open-world buffs to teammate cooldowns like Power Infusion and Innervate. Get alerts for feasts, portals, and same-class cooldowns too.
## Author: Gogo1951

